<td id="A6.T8.2.1.8.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E2F6E4;padding-top:0.6pt;padding-bottom:0.6pt;"><span id="A6.T8.2.1.8.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E2F6E4;">72.15</span></td>
<td id="A6.T8.2.1.8.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E2F6E4;padding-top:0.6pt;padding-bottom:0.6pt;"><span id="A6.T8.2.1.8.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E2F6E4;">52.95</span></td>
<td id="A6.T8.2.1.8.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E2F6E4;padding-top:0.6pt;padding-bottom:0.6pt;"><span id="A6.T8.2.1.8.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E2F6E4;">60.35</span></td>
<td id="A6.T8.2.1.8.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E2F6E4;padding-top:0.6pt;padding-bottom:0.6pt;"><span id="A6.T8.2.1.8.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E2F6E4;">54.08</span></td>
<td id="A6.T8.2.1.8.8" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_border_b" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E2F6E4;padding-top:0.6pt;padding-bottom:0.6pt;"><span id="A6.T8.2.1.8.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E2F6E4;">60.53</span></td></tr>
</table>
</span></div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Parameter Overhead</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For <math id="A7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> experts with hidden sizes <math id="A7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{d_{0},\ldots,d_{M-1}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{d_{0},\ldots,d_{M-1}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A7.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math> stacks (and thus <math id="A7.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math> interaction layers), shared latent dimension <math id="A7.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{s}</annotation></semantics></math>, and a frozen prompt encoder that outputs a <math id="A7.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{z}</annotation></semantics></math>-dimensional vector. The router has two layers with hidden width <math id="A7.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{r}</annotation></semantics></math> producing <math id="A7.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> scores. We count the additional (trainable) parameters due to MoT (omitting biases and layer normalization parameters for simplicity).</p>
</div>
<section id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Router.</h4>

<div id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A 2-layer MLP <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{z}\rightarrow h_{r}\rightarrow M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{z}\rightarrow h_{r}\rightarrow M</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A7.Ex7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{\#\theta_{\text{router}}\;=\;d_{z}h_{r}\;+\;h_{r}M~}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>router</mtext></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.502em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{\#\theta_{\text{router}}\;=\;d_{z}h_{r}\;+\;h_{r}M~}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Per-expert forward/reverse projectors (per stack).</h4>

<div id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">At each interaction layer <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q\!\in\!\{0,\ldots,Q\!-\!1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0.108em" rspace="0.108em">∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0.052em">−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q\!\in\!\{0,\ldots,Q\!-\!1\}</annotation></semantics></math> and for each expert <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math>, we use a forward projector <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{m}\!\times\!d_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.052em" rspace="0.052em">×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{m}\!\times\!d_{s}</annotation></semantics></math> and a reverse projector <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{s}\!\times\!d_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.052em" rspace="0.052em">×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{s}\!\times\!d_{m}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A7.Ex8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\#\theta_{\text{proj per layer}}\;=\;\sum_{m=0}^{M-1}\!\big(d_{m}d_{s}+d_{s}d_{m}\big)\;=\;2d_{s}\sum_{m=0}^{M-1}\!d_{m}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>proj per layer</mtext></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.391em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" rspace="0.280em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn> 2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\#\theta_{\text{proj per layer}}\;=\;\sum_{m=0}^{M-1}\!\big(d_{m}d_{s}+d_{s}d_{m}\big)\;=\;2d_{s}\sum_{m=0}^{M-1}\!d_{m},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A7.Ex9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{~\#\theta_{\text{proj total}}\;=\;Q\cdot\Big(2d_{s}\sum_{m=0}^{M-1}\!d_{m}\Big)~}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>proj total</mtext></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{~\#\theta_{\text{proj total}}\;=\;Q\cdot\Big(2d_{s}\sum_{m=0}^{M-1}\!d_{m}\Big)~}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Shared cross-attention per interaction layer.</h4>

<div id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We parameterize multi-head attention with four dense projections in the shared space: <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{Q},W_{K},W_{V},W_{O}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{s}\times d_{s}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>O</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{Q},W_{K},W_{V},W_{O}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{s}\times d_{s}}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A7.Ex10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\#\theta_{\text{attn per layer}}\;=\;4d_{s}^{2},\qquad\boxed{~\#\theta_{\text{attn total}}\;=\;Q\cdot 4d_{s}^{2}~}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>attn per layer</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn> 4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>attn total</mtext></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\#\theta_{\text{attn per layer}}\;=\;4d_{s}^{2},\qquad\boxed{~\#\theta_{\text{attn total}}\;=\;Q\cdot 4d_{s}^{2}~}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Total overhead.</h4>

<div id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Summing the three components:</p>
<table id="A7.Ex11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{~\#\theta_{\text{total}}\;=\;\underbrace{d_{z}h_{r}+h_{r}M}_{\text{router}}\;+\;\underbrace{Q\cdot\Big(2d_{s}\sum_{m=0}^{M-1}d_{m}\Big)}_{\text{proj. (all experts, all stacks)}}\;+\;\underbrace{Q\cdot 4d_{s}^{2}}_{\text{cross-attn (all stacks)}}~}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mrow><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>router</mtext></munder><mo rspace="0.502em">+</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>proj. (all experts, all stacks)</mtext></munder><mo rspace="0.502em">+</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>cross-attn (all stacks)</mtext></munder></mrow></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{~\#\theta_{\text{total}}\;=\;\underbrace{d_{z}h_{r}+h_{r}M}_{\text{router}}\;+\;\underbrace{Q\cdot\Big(2d_{s}\sum_{m=0}^{M-1}d_{m}\Big)}_{\text{proj. (all experts, all stacks)}}\;+\;\underbrace{Q\cdot 4d_{s}^{2}}_{\text{cross-attn (all stacks)}}~}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The added parameters scale (i) linearly with the number of experts via the projector terms, weighted by their hidden sizes <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{m}</annotation></semantics></math>, (ii) linearly with the number of stacks <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>, and (iii) quadratically with the shared latent size <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{s}</annotation></semantics></math> through the cross-attention block.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Parameter counts of individual models used in composition. Values are reported in billions (B).</figcaption>
<table id="A7.T9.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A7.T9.2.1" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F5F7FA;">
<td id="A7.T9.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.15pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A7.T9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F5F7FA;">Model</span></td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_right ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.15pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A7.T9.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F5F7FA;">Parameters (B)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T9.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T9.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.15pt 4.0pt;">Mistral-7B-v0.1</td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_right ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.15pt 4.0pt;">6.30</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T9.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T9.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:0.15pt 4.0pt;">MetaMath-Mistral-7B</td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_right" style="padding:0.15pt 4.0pt;">6.30</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T9.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T9.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:0.15pt 4.0pt;">Zephyr-7B-Beta</td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_right" style="padding:0.15pt 4.0pt;">6.30</td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T9.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T9.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:0.15pt 4.0pt;">Dolphin-2.6-Mistral-7B</td>
<td id="A7.T9.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_right" style="padding:0.15pt 4.0pt;">6.30</td></tr>
